== Notes ==

*This feat works against all [[creature]]s with the "giant" [[race|racial type]].
*The AC bonus is called "dodge", but it is actually one of the "[[armor class#Other sources of AC|other]]" sources of AC; it is not lost when [[flat-foot]]ed, and it stacks (uncapped) with all AC bonuses.

